# mise tasks run arbitrary code on every machine that runs `mise bootstrap` or
# `mise run`, so changes to them need an owner's review (ops PRD 02, S9).
/mise*.toml @waffuruai/owners
/mise.lock @waffuruai/owners
/mise-tasks/ @waffuruai/owners
# The commit hygiene gate: a PR that edits it could pass itself.
/scripts/commit_hygiene.py @waffuruai/owners
/.github/workflows/commit-hygiene.yml @waffuruai/owners
